{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule\/parallelRun(on:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"parallelRun","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"on","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"world","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V","text":"World","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Systems are grouped in the order they run: a system joins the group before it when it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has an access and conflicts with no system in the group. A group runs with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"WorldModule\/World\/runConcurrently(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so the world ends as it would after "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Schedule\/run(on:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A system without an access runs alone. Within a group, every condition is checked before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any system runs, so a condition reads only what its system’s access lists."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every system with an access reads and writes only what it lists; see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"WorldModule\/World\/runConcurrently(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"Precondition","t